          "id": "https://www.digitalarchives.cict.in/ground-truth/iiif/CICT-PLM-GT-031/canvas/annotations",
          "type": "AnnotationPage",
          "items": [
            {
              "id": "https://www.digitalarchives.cict.in/ground-truth/iiif/CICT-PLM-GT-031/anno/line-1",
              "type": "Annotation",
              "motivation": "supplementing",
              "body": {
                "type": "TextualBody",
                "language": "ta",
                "format": "text/plain",
                "value": "இறந்தா ரிறந்தா ரநையர் சினத்தைத் துறந்தார் துறந்தார் துணை"
              },
              "target": "https://www.digitalarchives.cict.in/ground-truth/iiif/CICT-PLM-GT-031/canvas#xywh=0,104,2761,36"
            },
            {
              "id": "https://www.digitalarchives.cict.in/ground-truth/iiif/CICT-PLM-GT-031/anno/line-2",
              "type": "Annotation",
              "motivation": "supplementing",
              "body": {
                "type": "TextualBody",
                "language": "ta",
                "format": "text/plain",
                "value": "செல்லா விடத்திற் சிநந்தீது செல்லிடத்து மில்லதநிற் றீய பிற"
              },
              "target": "https://www.digitalarchives.cict.in/ground-truth/iiif/CICT-PLM-GT-031/canvas#xywh=0,140,2761,37"
            },
            {
              "id": "https://www.digitalarchives.cict.in/ground-truth/iiif/CICT-PLM-GT-031/anno/line-3",
              "type": "Annotation",
              "motivation": "supplementing",
              "body": {
                "type": "TextualBody",
                "language": "ta",
                "format": "text/plain",
                "value": "செல்லிடத்துக் கார்ப்பான் சிநங்காப்பா நல்லிடத்துக் காக்கிலென் காவாக்கி லென்"
              },
              "target": "https://www.digitalarchives.cict.in/ground-truth/iiif/CICT-PLM-GT-031/canvas#xywh=0,177,2761,37"
            },
            {
              "id": "https://www.digitalarchives.cict.in/ground-truth/iiif/CICT-PLM-GT-031/anno/line-4",
              "type": "Annotation",
              "motivation": "supplementing",
              "body": {
                "type": "TextualBody",
                "language": "ta",
                "format": "text/plain",
                "value": "தந்நைத்தான் கார்க்கிற் சிநங்கார்க்கக் காவாக்காற் றந்நையே கொல்லுஞ் சிநம்"
              },
              "target": "https://www.digitalarchives.cict.in/ground-truth/iiif/CICT-PLM-GT-031/canvas#xywh=0,214,2761,37"
            },
            {
              "id": "https://www.digitalarchives.cict.in/ground-truth/iiif/CICT-PLM-GT-031/anno/line-5",
              "type": "Annotation",
              "motivation": "supplementing",
              "body": {
                "type": "TextualBody",
                "language": "ta",
                "format": "text/plain",
                "value": "சிநத்தைப் பொருளென்று கொண்டவன் கேடு நிலத்தறைந்தான் கைபிழையா தற்று"
              },
              "target": "https://www.digitalarchives.cict.in/ground-truth/iiif/CICT-PLM-GT-031/canvas#xywh=0,251,2761,36"
            },
            {
              "id": "https://www.digitalarchives.cict.in/ground-truth/iiif/CICT-PLM-GT-031/anno/line-6",
              "type": "Annotation",
              "motivation": "supplementing",
              "body": {
                "type": "TextualBody",
                "language": "ta",
                "format": "text/plain",
                "value": "சிநமெந்நுஞ் சேர்ந்தாரைக் கொல்லி யிநமெந்நு மேமப் புநையைச் சுடும்"
              },
              "target": "https://www.digitalarchives.cict.in/ground-truth/iiif/CICT-PLM-GT-031/canvas#xywh=0,287,2761,37"
            },
            {
              "id": "https://www.digitalarchives.cict.in/ground-truth/iiif/CICT-PLM-GT-031/anno/line-7",
              "type": "Annotation",
              "motivation": "supplementing",
              "body": {
                "type": "TextualBody",
                "language": "ta",
                "format": "text/plain",
                "value": "நகையு முவகையுங் கொல்லுஞ் சினத்திற்பகையு முளவொ பிற"
              },
              "target": "https://www.digitalarchives.cict.in/ground-truth/iiif/CICT-PLM-GT-031/canvas#xywh=0,324,2761,37"
            },
            {
              "id": "https://www.digitalarchives.cict.in/ground-truth/iiif/CICT-PLM-GT-031/anno/line-8",
              "type": "Annotation",
              "motivation": "supplementing",
              "body": {
                "type": "TextualBody",
                "language": "ta",
                "format": "text/plain",
                "value": "மறத்தல் வெகுளியை யார்மாட்டுந் தீய பிறத்த லதநால் வரும்"
              },
              "target": "https://www.digitalarchives.cict.in/ground-truth/iiif/CICT-PLM-GT-031/canvas#xywh=0,361,2761,36"
            },
            {
              "id": "https://www.digitalarchives.cict.in/ground-truth/iiif/CICT-PLM-GT-031/anno/line-9",
              "type": "Annotation",
              "motivation": "supplementing",
              "body": {
                "type": "TextualBody",
                "language": "ta",
                "format": "text/plain",
                "value": "இணரெறி தோய்வந்ந யின்னா செயிநும்புணரின் வெகுளாமை நன்று"
              },
              "target": "https://www.digitalarchives.cict.in/ground-truth/iiif/CICT-PLM-GT-031/canvas#xywh=0,397,2761,37"
            },
            {
              "id": "https://www.digitalarchives.cict.in/ground-truth/iiif/CICT-PLM-GT-031/anno/line-10",
              "type": "Annotation",
              "motivation": "supplementing",
              "body": {
                "type": "TextualBody",
                "language": "ta",
                "format": "text/plain",
                "value": "உள்ளிய தெல்லா முடனெய்தும் உள்ளத்தா னுள்ளான் வெகுளி யெநில்"
              },
              "target": "https://www.digitalarchives.cict.in/ground-truth/iiif/CICT-PLM-GT-031/canvas#xywh=0,434,2761,37"
            },
            {
              "id": "https://www.digitalarchives.cict.in/ground-truth/iiif/CICT-PLM-GT-031/anno/margin-4",
              "type": "Annotation",
              "motivation": "supplementing",
              "body": {
